WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.200
I think the future of the Arctic will be wet.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.840
I think the Arctic is likely to disappear.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.320
And I guess that means we will

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.640
be thinking back at the Arctic as this

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.600
white icey stuff that once you could

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.480
walk on it and there would be these white

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.020
fluffy bears called ice bears walking on them.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.160
So I'm so sorry to disappoint you

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.500
with this very negative view

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.300
but the way things look right now

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.660
it seems that we're not

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.100
going to have an Arctic quite soon.

